    <string name="manifesto">ASD = Anarchic Streaming Device (Na\'urar Watsa Waƙa ta Hargitsi).\n\"Watsawa\" daga ma\'adanar wayarka zuwa kunnuwanka ne, shi ke nan.\n\n· Ana amfani da hanyar sadarwa ne kawai don Google Drive da TUBE, kuma idan ka yi amfani da su ne kawai.\n· Babu asusu, babu talla, babu bin diddiki.\n· Jerin waƙoƙi na zaune a waya. Share su ba ya taɓa fayilolin.\n· ASD ba ta taɓa share fayilolinka: don cire ɗaya, yi amfani da waya ko Drive.\n· Farashi: 0€. Har abada.</string>
